{"name":"Evening Cityscape","hex":"#4b535c","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"evening","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The time of day between afternoon and night.","The time of the day between the approximate time of midwinter dusk and midnight (compare afternoon); the period after the end of regular office working hours."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of even"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/evening"},{"term":"cityscape","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The view of the buildings of a city, usually referring to a pictured landscape."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cityscape"}],"entries":[{"title":"Evening","blocks":[{"text":"Evening is the period of a day that begins at the end of afternoon and overlaps with the beginning of night. It starts when the sun is close to the horizon and, according to most definitions, spans the period of night before bedtime or midnight. The exact times when evening begins and ends are subjective and depend on location and time of year. In some cases, evening is considered to begin during daylight; before sunset."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Evening_in_Parambikkulam%2C_Kerala%2C_India.jpg/330px-Evening_in_Parambikkulam%2C_Kerala%2C_India.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Evening"},{"title":"Cityscape","blocks":[{"text":"In the visual arts, a cityscape is an artistic representation, such as a painting, drawing, print or photograph, of the physical aspects of a city or urban area. It is the urban equivalent of a landscape. Townscape is roughly synonymous with cityscape, though it implies the same difference in urban size and density implicit in the difference between the words city and town. In urban design the terms refer to the configuration of built forms and interstitial space."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/The_Dam_in_Amsterdam%2C_by_Gerrit_Adriaensz_Berckheyde.jpg/330px-The_Dam_in_Amsterdam%2C_by_Gerrit_Adriaensz_Berckheyde.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cityscape"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Evening_view_on_the_bay_of_Naples%2C_overlooking_Mount_Vesuvius.jpg/500px-Evening_view_on_the_bay_of_Naples%2C_overlooking_Mount_Vesuvius.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Evening_view_on_the_bay_of_Naples%2C_overlooking_Mount_Vesuvius.jpg/1280px-Evening_view_on_the_bay_of_Naples%2C_overlooking_Mount_Vesuvius.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Evening_view_on_the_bay_of_Naples%2C_overlooking_Mount_Vesuvius.jpg/500px-Evening_view_on_the_bay_of_Naples%2C_overlooking_Mount_Vesuvius.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"View on the bay of Naples, overlooking Mount Vesuvius at sunset","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEvening_view_on_the_bay_of_Naples%2C_overlooking_Mount_Vesuvius.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Dresden_photochrom2.jpg/500px-Dresden_photochrom2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Dresden_photochrom2.jpg/1280px-Dresden_photochrom2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Dresden_photochrom2.jpg/500px-Dresden_photochrom2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Photograph of Dresden, Germany, in the 1890s","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADresden_photochrom2.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Monet_Houses_of_Parliament%2C_Sunset.jpg/500px-Monet_Houses_of_Parliament%2C_Sunset.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Monet_Houses_of_Parliament%2C_Sunset.jpg/1280px-Monet_Houses_of_Parliament%2C_Sunset.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Monet_Houses_of_Parliament%2C_Sunset.jpg/500px-Monet_Houses_of_Parliament%2C_Sunset.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Houses of Parliament, Sunset, 1902, by Claude Monet","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMonet_Houses_of_Parliament%2C_Sunset.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/Going_to_Work%2C_Lowry.png/500px-Going_to_Work%2C_Lowry.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/Going_to_Work%2C_Lowry.png/1280px-Going_to_Work%2C_Lowry.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/Going_to_Work%2C_Lowry.png/500px-Going_to_Work%2C_Lowry.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Going to Work by L. S. Lowry","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGoing_to_Work%2C_Lowry.png"}],"sounds":{"evening":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/En-uk-evening.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a4/En-uk-evening.ogg/En-uk-evening.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ea/En-us-evening_%28noun%29.o